      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORAINE SARA (7) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.5 lengths (28.23) behind Chill Out Plate at this track. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. JACQUI MOSS (4) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fourth (26.01) at Shepparton. Strike rate this course strong having won three of six tries. Has a strong record from box 4, including two wins. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. MORAINE DAMIAN (1) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a second place finish (28.33) there two back. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Key runner on best form. MAGIC LOKI (8) deserves plenty of thought over this trip.",
